  "name": "效果：灵魂燃尽 Soul Burn",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/wang-pf2e-homebrew/assets/hunt/trait-necromancer.png",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>灵魂被灼蚀抽干。此效果带有层数徽章，可挂在任意生物上。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每层使你的<strong>生命值上限减少 10</strong>（已自动化）。</li>\n<li>首次获得或层数上升时，当前生命值同步失去等量数值（不视为受到攻击伤害）。</li>\n<li>再次施加时自动<strong>+1 层</strong>（上限 6）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>移除</strong>：由 GM 裁定的净化、长休或特定剧情手段；层数不会随回合自动消退。</p>",
      "gm": "<p>通用减上限状态。FlatModifier hp = -10×层数；LoseHitPoints 同步。叠层由 hunt-showdown-automation 的 preCreateItem 处理。</p>"
    },
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selector": "hp",
        "slug": "hunt-soul-burn",
        "type": "untyped",
        "value": "-10 * @item.badge.value",
        "label": "灵魂燃尽"
      },
      {
        "key": "LoseHitPoints",
        "reevaluateOnUpdate": true,
        "value": "10 * @item.badge.value"
      }
    ],
